143
00:09:07,380 --> 00:09:10,380
I like your hairpiece, number six!

144
00:09:10,380 --> 00:09:11,380
Thank you!

145
00:09:11,380 --> 00:09:12,380
Everybody sit down by me!

146
00:09:12,380 --> 00:09:13,380
