147
00:09:13,380 --> 00:09:15,380
You twerps ain't ready for this!

148
00:09:15,380 --> 00:09:16,380
I need it!

149
00:09:17,380 --> 00:09:18,380
Hey, check it out!

150
00:09:18,380 --> 00:09:20,380
I think this is just about everybody!

151
00:09:20,380 --> 00:09:22,380
Make room, okay?

152
00:09:22,380 --> 00:09:23,380
Alright, it's showtime.

153
00:09:23,380 --> 00:09:27,380
We're gonna sing a couple songs for you guys, so eyes up here, okay?

154
00:09:27,380 --> 00:09:31,380
One, two, three, four!

155
00:09:31,380 --> 00:09:33,380
Awaken, returner!

156
00:09:33,380 --> 00:09:35,380
Let your heartfelt desire!

157
00:09:35,380 --> 00:09:39,380
A longing for miracles that can inspire!

158
00:09:39,380 --> 00:09:41,380
Gotta get it right if we're gonna survive!

159
00:09:41,380 --> 00:09:43,380
Never gonna stop with a dud and run live!

160
00:09:43,380 --> 00:09:45,380
Livin' life the best we can!

161
00:09:45,380 --> 00:09:46,380
Goin' down our destined path!

162
00:09:46,380 --> 00:09:47,380
Do-Do-Do-Do-Do-Do-Do-Do-Do!

163
00:09:47,380 --> 00:09:48,380
Do-Do-Do-Do-Do-Do-Do!

164
00:09:48,380 --> 00:09:49,380
Do-Do-Do-Do-Do-Do-Do!

165
00:09:49,380 --> 00:09:50,380
Do-Do-Do-Do-Do-Do-Do!

166
00:09:50,380 --> 00:09:51,380
Do-Do-Do-Do-Do-Do-Do-Do!

167
00:09:51,380 --> 00:09:55,380
Do-Do-Do-Do-Do-Do!

168
00:09:55,380 --> 00:09:59,380
Do-Do-Do-Do-Do-Do-Do-Do-Do!

169
00:09:59,380 --> 00:10:00,380
Huh?

170
00:10:01,380 --> 00:10:02,380
Huh, hmmm!

171
00:10:02,380 --> 00:10:03,380
Boop!

172
00:10:07,380 --> 00:10:11,380
Have you been performing every evening?

173
00:10:11,380 --> 00:10:13,380
Yeah, we have actually!

174
00:10:13,380 --> 00:10:15,380
During the day we help out with getting the chores done,

175
00:10:15,380 --> 00:10:18,380
and then at night we put on a little show for the kids, you know?

176
00:10:18,380 --> 00:10:21,380
It must be a great show. I saw lots of smiles.

177
00:10:21,380 --> 00:10:23,380
Oh, I mean, it's no big deal.

178
00:10:23,380 --> 00:10:26,380
We're just trying to do whatever we can to make things a little easier here.

179
00:10:26,380 --> 00:10:28,380
