185
00:10:47,380 --> 00:10:51,380
Uh, you know what I mean. We're just doing what we have to do.

186
00:10:58,380 --> 00:10:59,380
Who could?

187
00:10:59,380 --> 00:11:00,380
Still alive.

188
00:11:00,380 --> 00:11:03,380
I won't die.

189
00:11:03,380 --> 00:11:06,380
Yoo-hoo! Anybody down here?

190
00:11:06,380 --> 00:11:10,380
I hope not, cause my pants are already soaked through and I'd prefer to leave!

191
00:11:10,380 --> 00:11:14,380
Come help us! Please, we're down here!

192
