199
00:11:35,380 --> 00:11:38,380
Uh, wait, don't go! I have several questions to ask you!

200
00:11:38,380 --> 00:11:42,380
Not that you'll listen, but please don't be foolish!

201
00:11:42,380 --> 00:11:44,380
You're gonna live, old friend.

202
00:11:45,380 --> 00:11:49,380
Because Franz Shushu is about to save Saga.

203
00:11:53,380 --> 00:11:56,380
Let's each do our best again today!

204
00:11:56,380 --> 00:11:57,380
