321
00:18:15,580 --> 00:18:17,080
how they feel deep inside.

322
00:18:18,720 --> 00:18:20,540
Dead or alive,

323
00:18:20,540 --> 00:18:22,880
Front choo-choo are idols.

324
00:18:22,880 --> 00:18:24,880
Take away all the bells and whistles,

325
00:18:24,880 --> 00:18:27,200
